msgstr "Skelim sapos piksa/PDF file i stap long sistem. Sapos yu bin makim wanpela o planti PDF bilong Front/Back matter o wanpela Watermark PDF orait lukim sapos ol PDF i stap o nogat; O rausim mak bilong ol dispela opesen (Advanced tab)."

#: lib/ptxprint/runjob.py:51
