msgstr "Piksa: Sampela narapela samting"

#: temp.glade:29567
msgid "Use this tab to change the position, location, size \n"
"or orientation of the images.\n\n"
"Note: Any changes you make here will NOT be \n"
"reflected in the Paratext USFM files. So if you are \n"
"changing an illustration, its caption or frame size\n"
"(column or span), then it is advisable to do so\n"
"in Paratext before regenerating the PicList here."
msgstr "Yu ken yusim dispela tab bilong senisim ples, ples, bikpela o sait bilong ol piksa. Tingim: Ol senis yu mekim long dispela hap bai NO kamap long ol file bilong Paratext USFM. Olsem na sapos yu senisim piksa, hap tok bilong en o bikpela bilong en (kolom o hap bilong piksa), orait yu mas mekim olsem long Paratext paslain long yu wokim gen dispela PicList."

#: temp.glade:29575
msgid "Details"
msgstr "Ol stori moa"

#: temp.glade:29632
msgid "Is there anything confusing or misleading in this image that the reader might misunderstand if they look at this picture apart from the text? Yes and no are both appropriate answers as some images may need to be seen alongside text in order to be understood."
msgstr "Sapos man i no ritim ol tok bilong dispela piksa, ating em bai kisim tingting kranki long ol tok bilong dispela piksa, olsem: Yes na nogat, dispela tupela tok i stret, long wanem, sampela piksa i mas stap wantaim ol tok bilong en bambai man i ken kliagut long en."

#: temp.glade:29634
msgid "Is it clear what is happening in this image?"
msgstr "Yu save long samting i kamap long dispela piksa?"

#: temp.glade:29645
msgid "First consider whether this picture is appropriate and culturally acceptable in any publications for this project."
msgstr "Pastaim skelim olsem dispela piksa i stret o nogat long ol buk na nius bilong dispela wok."

#: temp.glade:29647
msgid "Across Various Publications:"
msgstr "Long Ol Narapela Buk:"

#: temp.glade:29661 temp.glade:29929 temp.glade:29983
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Orait"

#: temp.glade:29662
msgid "Picture checklist: What is happening is clear"
msgstr "Ol piksa i soim klia wanem samting i kamap"

#: temp.glade:29679 temp.glade:29947 temp.glade:30001
msgid "No"
msgstr "Nogat"

#: temp.glade:29680
msgid "Picture checklist: What is happening is NOT clear"
msgstr "Ol piksa i soim olsem: Yumi no save gut long wanem samting i kamap"

#: temp.glade:29698
msgid "Picture checklist: Not checked for clarity"
msgstr "Ol piksa i no klia tumas"

#: temp.glade:29717
msgid "Be sure that there is nothing offensive or inappropriate in this image. This could be the way people are clothed, what actions they are doing, how they are depicted, etc. “Culturally Appropriate” means this image is in a style from this culture or a related one, “Acceptable” means this picture might be from a different culture or in a different style, but there are no issues using it. “Inappropriate” means there are issues that should prevent this image from being used. Answering “Inappropriate” will help avoid this image being used in other publications."
msgstr "Yu mas save olsem i no gat wanpela samting i no stret long dispela piksa. Dispela inap makim olsem ol manmeri i werim klos, ol samting ol i mekim, olsem wanem ol i stap long piksa, na ol narapela samting. Sapos yu bekim olsem I no stret dispela bai helpim yu long abrusim ol narapela buk na nius i no ken yusim dispela piksa."

#: temp.glade:29719
msgid "Is this image acceptable in your culture?"
msgstr "Yu ting dispela kain piksa i stret long ples bilong yu?"

#: temp.glade:29730
msgid "Sometimes mirroring (reversing) an image makes it\n"
"acceptable since a left hand becomes a right hand, etc.\n\n"
"Some artists' pictures do not take into account\n"
"the \"dirty left-hand\" culture. For example, it would\n"
"be \"awkward\" to use a picture where Jesus is healing\n"
"a person using his left hand!"
msgstr "Sampela taim, taim ol man i tanim piksa i go long narapela hap, dispela i mekim na ol man i orait long en, long wanem, han kais i kamap han sut, na ol narapela samting."

#: temp.glade:29738
msgid "Would the image be culturally acceptable if \n"
"the image was mirrored (left becomes right)?"
msgstr "Sapos piksa i kamap long han kais, yu ting dispela bai stret long ol man i gat wankain tingting long en?"

#: temp.glade:29750 temp.glade:30072
msgid "Now consider whether there are any issues with using this picture in this particular publication (config-specific)."
msgstr "Nau skelim sapos i gat sampela hevi long yusim dispela piksa long dispela buk (long sait bilong ol samting yu laik stretim)."

#: temp.glade:29752
msgid "In This Publication:"
msgstr "Long Dispela Buk:"

#: temp.glade:29768
msgid "Consider how this image is used alongside the text and what function it serves. Maybe it depicts a building or item from a biblical culture, or a scene from a story."
msgstr "Tingim olsem wanem ol i yusim dispela piksa wantaim tok bilong Baibel na wok bilong en."

#: temp.glade:29770
msgid "Is this picture intended for: clarification,\n"
"story enhancement, filler, unknown?"
msgstr "Dispela piksa i bilong helpim yu long save gut long sampela samting, o bilong helpim stori, o bilong helpim yu long kisim sampela save moa?"

#: temp.glade:29782
msgid "Does the image support what the text is saying? As they read the passage does the image help in their understanding?"
msgstr "Taim ol i ritim dispela ves, dispela piksa i helpim ol long kliagut long as bilong en?"

#: temp.glade:29784
msgid "In the context of this passage, is it clear \n"
"what is happening in this image?"
msgstr "Olsem wanem? Dispela stori i kamapim klia wanem samting i kamap long dispela piksa?"

#: temp.glade:29796
msgid "For example, do the colors have the same meaning in the local culture? Is there anything in the background that is distracting from the story? Are there any objects, gestures, or other things that imply something unintended or that isn’t in the passage? Are there any anachronisms in the picture (a minaret in Bethlehem)?"
msgstr "Olsem: Ol kala i gat wankain mining long ol ples? I gat sampela samting i stap long baksait i pulim tingting bilong man long stori? I gat sampela samting, pasin bilong mekim ol samting, o sampela samting i no stret long tingting bilong man o i no stap long stori? I gat sampela samting i no stret long taim bilong en long piksa (wanpela minaret long Betlehem)?"

#: temp.glade:29798
msgid "Does the image communicate something \n"
"that it should not in this particular context?"
msgstr "Dispela piksa i kamapim sampela tok em i no ken kamapim long dispela hap?"

#: temp.glade:29810
msgid "Do the images and their style fit with the type of publication, i.e. Scripture, children’s materials, lectionary, etc.? Are people and actions depicted in acceptable ways?"
msgstr "Ol piksa na pasin bilong ol i stret wantaim ol tok bilong buk, olsem Baibel, ol buk bilong ol pikinini, ol buk bilong skulim ol pikinini, na ol narapela samting?"

#: temp.glade:29812
msgid "Is the image appropriate for the publication?"
msgstr "Dispela piksa i stret long dispela nius?"

#: temp.glade:29821
